bp?t=1746268177\" width=151 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either sell fish to gain Pico or fillet your fish for a chance of obtaining fish bait of the next higher rarity. Fishing with bait ensures a 50% catch rate of fish from this rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/49767180159f52adc541b8830558bcf0.poster.avif?t=1746268177\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/49767180159f52adc541b8830558bcf0.webm?t=1746268177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/49767180159f52adc541b8830558bcf0.mp4?t=1746268177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Islands, Terraforming, Paths &amp; Placeable Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islands are procedurally generated. You can terraform everything above sand level and create paths. Place objects like your camp or lighthouse freely to customize your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Quality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from scratch with a custom engine, Pelican Harbor excels in high performance and smooth gameplay, even on low-end systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/1292bf66c4a683c107ef814ede9e1dde.poster.avif?t=1746268177\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste